  "description": "<p>This mod changes all 2x1 ammo boxes to 1x1. It also changes the background color based on rarity: Super Rare = Violet, Rare = Blue, and the rest are Yellow.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>📁<strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drag folder from zip file directly into your SPT install folder</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>❗<strong>NOTE: EFT caches your item icons. If something looks off, press the “Clean Temp Files” button in your SPT launcher to fix it.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Based on and inspired by the source code from the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2373/slimmer-magazines\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Slimmer Magazines</a> mod.</em></p>\n",
